From: Haldexx
Subject: [PATCH] sysmon: complete the disabled diagnostic notification interface

ESOC calls sysmon_send_diag_disable_noti even without MSM_SYSMON_COMM.
The header supplies disabled stubs for the other sysmon operations but
omits this one, causing a Clang implicit-function-declaration error.
Match the documented disabled behavior and the adjacent shutdown stub.

diff --git a/include/linux/sysmon.h b/include/linux/sysmon.h
--- a/include/linux/sysmon.h
+++ b/include/linux/sysmon.h
@@ -58,6 +58,10 @@ static inline int sysmon_send_shutdown(enum subsys_id dest_ss)
 {
 	return 0;
 }
+static inline int sysmon_send_diag_disable_noti(enum subsys_id dest_ss)
+{
+	return 0;
+}
 #endif
 
 #endif
